# ==============================================================================
# Docker Build Context Ignore Rules (.dockerignore)
# 《十日终焉》小说语音问答与测试容器
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Version control systems
.git
.gitignore

# 2. Agent metadata, backups and workspace scratch
.agents
.agents/
.agents/teamwork/
.gemini
.gemini/
.zcode
.zcode/
.backup
.backup/

# 3. CI/CD workflow definitions
.github
.github/

# 4. Python bytecode, caches and testing artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
test-results/
.coverage
.coverage*
*.coverage*
.coverage/
htmlcov/
*.log
*.bak*
*.bak
output*.txt

# 5. Virtual environments
.env
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/

# 6. Operating system files and temporary files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp

# 7. Third-party non-runtime configuration & datasets
shuyuan*.json

# 8. Exclude large raw text books and chunk files (>24MB total)
#    - books/十日终焉/原文.txt: 9.0 MB raw novel corpus
#    - books/十日终焉.txt: 6.0 MB unpartitioned text
#    - books/十日终焉/chunks/: 8.9 MB split slices (42 files)
books/*.txt
books/十日终焉/原文.txt
books/十日终焉/chunks/

# 9. Preserve essential runtime and test artifacts (White-listing)
#    - books/十日终焉/问答库/档案.jsonl: 999 精读 QA entries (~780KB)
#    - books/十日终焉/精读总集.md: 46.6万字结构化笔记与深度检索总集 (~456KB)
#    - books/十日终焉/notes/: 42篇分块笔记 (~472KB)
#    - books/十日终焉/分析/: 4篇结构化分析 (~72KB)
!books/十日终焉/问答库/
!books/十日终焉/问答库/档案.jsonl
!books/十日终焉/精读总集.md
!books/十日终焉/notes/
!books/十日终焉/notes/*
!books/十日终焉/分析/
!books/十日终焉/分析/*
